    ("    return (xor32(hash, value) * 16777619) % 4294967296;\n\x7D\n\nfunc djbByte(hash: int, value: int): int \x7B\n    return (hash * 33 + value) % 4294967296;\n\x7D\n\npub func fnv1a(data: string): int \x7B\n    v" +
