    "1;\n    \x7D\n    return out;\n\x7D\n\n// Execute an HTTP request. A successful curl invocation returns\n// Result.Ok(\x7Bstatus: int, ok: bool, body: string, stderr: string\x7D); failures\n// return Result.Err(")) +
